          "current_app_scope": "Original dependency-free KDBX 3.1 import and 4.0/4.1 import/export support bounded native AES/ChaCha20, AES-KDF/Argon2, compression, protected fields and preserved XML/attachments. UI exports 4.1. KDB/KDBX 2.x/3.0, 3.1 export, future/plugin formats, full schema validation and broad real-world files remain absent or unverified.",
          "evidence": [
